\\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T73a,\\u003ch1\\u003eMetaPortal 1.8\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eGet ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMixed reality LED gateway for metaverse experiences.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLED display portal designed for bridging physical and metaverse environments. Ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate eliminates motion blur for AR/VR pass-through applications. Built-in depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras enable gesture-based interaction with virtual objects. Supports WebXR, OpenXR, and major metaverse platforms.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of MetaPortal 1.8 and why is it important?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MetaPortal 1.8 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures high-resolution visuals and fine detail suitable for immersive mixed reality environments. A smaller pixel pitch provides sharper images, essential for close-viewing AR/VR applications.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the 15360Hz refresh rate enhance the user experience?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate effectively eliminates motion blur, which is crucial for seamless AR/VR pass-through visualizations and reduces eye strain during extended use. This results in smooth and realistic mixed reality experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat types of sensors are integrated into the MetaPortal 1.8?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMetaPortal 1.8 comes equipped with depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras, enabling gesture-based interactions with virtual objects. These sensors facilitate natural, intuitive user engagement within metaverse portals and mixed reality setups.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the MetaPortal 1.8 compatible with popular metaverse platforms?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"MetaPortal 1.8 - Ultra Fine Pixel Pitch LED Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\