ghtluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T73a,<h1>MetaPortal 1.8</h1><p>Get ultra-fine pixel pitch with MetaPortal 1.8 LED display in Dubai. Perfect for crisp visuals. Contact Brightluxx for UAE LED display solutions.</p><p><strong>Mixed reality LED gateway for metaverse experiences.</strong></p><p>LED display portal designed for bridging physical and metaverse environments. Ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate eliminates motion blur for AR/VR pass-through applications. Built-in depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras enable gesture-based interaction with virtual objects. Supports WebXR, OpenXR, and major metaverse platforms.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of MetaPortal 1.8 and why is it important?</h3><p>The MetaPortal 1.8 features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, which ensures high-resolution visuals and fine detail suitable for immersive mixed reality environments. A smaller pixel pitch provides sharper images, essential for close-viewing AR/VR applications.</p><h3>How does the 15360Hz refresh rate enhance the user experience?</h3><p>The ultra-fast 15360Hz refresh rate effectively eliminates motion blur, which is crucial for seamless AR/VR pass-through visualizations and reduces eye strain during extended use. This results in smooth and realistic mixed reality experiences.</p><h3>What types of sensors are integrated into the MetaPortal 1.8?</h3><p>MetaPortal 1.8 comes equipped with depth sensors and hand-tracking cameras, enabling gesture-based interactions with virtual objects. These sensors facilitate natural, intuitive user engagement within metaverse portals and mixed reality setups.</p><h3>Is the MetaPortal 1.8 compatible with popular metaverse platforms?</h3><p>Yes, it supports WebXR and OpenXR protocols, allowing seamless integration with major metaverse platforms and applications, ensuring versatility and future-proofing for evolving virtual experiences.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOu